## Upstream import validation
After edits, validate all `from vllm.*` imports in changed files **and** modules pytest/registry loads indirectly:
{PYTHON3_CMD} -c "import ast, importlib, sys
for fpath in sys.argv[1:]:
    with open(fpath) as f: tree = ast.parse(f.read())
    for node in ast.walk(tree):
        if isinstance(node, ast.ImportFrom) and node.module and node.module.startswith('vllm.'):
            mod = importlib.import_module(node.module)
            for alias in node.names:
                assert hasattr(mod, alias.name), f'BROKEN: {fpath}:{node.lineno} from {node.module} import {alias.name}'
    print(f'  OK  {fpath}')
" <list of files you changed, plus registry/runtime deps if imports are indirect>

